      "writtenOn": "2016-08-18T22:03:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "20 us would be questionable, but ~4uS could be just fine.\n\nI think one timer should be enough, on one hand saving on complexity of moving the values around, but on the other hand requiring some adjustments where us counters are required.\n\nLet\u0027s see what others think.",
      "parentUuid": "9b24e748_8be5b8d0",
